WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.350
Every visit has a story.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.850
Reviyo helps your customers find the words to share theirs,

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.560
with a simple QR code and an editable review draft.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.790
Place your review QR at the counter, on a table,

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.430
or with a bill.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:19.355
Customers scan with their phone camera to open your page.

00:00:19.355 --> 00:00:22.215
No app or customer signup is needed.

00:00:22.915 --> 00:00:26.760
They choose relevant topics, add their own comment, and give

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.865
consent for a draft.

00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:32.595
The prompts help them describe their actual experience.

00:00:32.595 --> 00:00:36.150
Customers are never filtered by how their visit went.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.215
Reviyo uses their input to prepare a draft.

00:00:40.215 --> 00:00:43.450
They read it, correct anything that is not right, and

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.955
make it sound like themselves.

00:00:45.955 --> 00:00:48.170
The opinion stays theirs.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.580
When they are ready, they copy the text and open

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.680
your Google review page.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.185
They choose their stars on Google and post from their

00:00:56.185 --> 00:00:57.715
own account.

00:00:57.715 --> 00:01:00.045
Reviyo never posts for them.

00:01:00.745 --> 00:01:05.165
As the owner, customise your topics, print your QR, and

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:08.095
see where customers stop in the journey.

00:01:08.095 --> 00:01:12.570
Invite everyone the same way, with no rewards for reviews.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.980
Start with a free review QR, or explore Reviyo at

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:17.725
reviyo dot in.
